        "***\n",
        "## Transformation Processes\n",
        "\n",
        "### Transformation Overview\n",
        "\n",
        "This section takes the raw 2023 NFL play-by-play data and turns it into a cleaner team-level dataset. Instead of leaving the data as one row per play, we create a final dataset with one row per team and several summary metrics.\n",
        "\n",
        "The four metrics we create are:\n",
        "\n",
        "1. Pass rate on 1st and 2nd down with 10+ yards to go\n",
        "2. Fourth down conversion attempts and success rate\n",
        "3. Average number of plays per scoring drive\n",
        "4. Red zone touchdown rate\n",
        "\n",
        "### Check That the Raw Data Is Available"
      ],
      "id": "eeaafc06"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "# If the Source & Extraction section already ran, pbp should already exist.\n",
        "# This backup makes the section easier to run by itself if needed.\n",
        "\n",
        "try:\n",
        "    pbp\n",
        "except NameError:\n",
        "    pbp = nfl.load_pbp(seasons=[2023]).to_pandas()\n",
        "\n",
        "print(f\"Raw data available: {pbp.shape[0]:,} plays and {pbp.shape[1]} columns\")"
      ],
      "id": "cb309965",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "### Step 1: Filter to Regular Season Games\n",
        "\n",
        "We are focusing on regular season tendencies, so we remove postseason games."
      ],
      "id": "26b8f2a2"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "pbp_reg = pbp[pbp[\"season_type\"] == \"REG\"].copy()\n",
        "\n",
        "print(f\"Regular season plays: {pbp_reg.shape[0]:,}\")\n",
        "print(f\"Removed {pbp.shape[0] - pbp_reg.shape[0]:,} non-regular-season plays\")"
      ],
      "id": "a2c3cde9",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "### Step 2: Create a Red Zone Indicator\n",
        "\n",
        "The raw data has `yardline_100`, but we create a simpler `in_red_zone` column to make the red zone question easier to answer."
      ],
      "id": "08b76d06"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "pbp_reg[\"in_red_zone\"] = (pbp_reg[\"yardline_100\"] <= 20).astype(int)\n",
        "\n",
        "red_zone_count = pbp_reg[\"in_red_zone\"].sum()\n",
        "print(f\"Red zone plays: {red_zone_count:,}\")"
      ],
      "id": "cf1bdae1",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "### Step 3: Keep Scrimmage Plays\n",
        "\n",
        "For most of our questions, we only want normal offensive plays. This removes plays like kickoffs and extra points."
      ],
      "id": "d322536f"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "pbp_scrimmage = pbp_reg[\n",
        "    (pbp_reg[\"play_type\"].isin([\"pass\", \"run\", \"qb_kneel\", \"qb_spike\"])) |\n",
        "    (pbp_reg[\"pass\"] == 1) |\n",
        "    (pbp_reg[\"rush\"] == 1)\n",
        "].copy()\n",
        "\n",
        "print(f\"Scrimmage plays: {pbp_scrimmage.shape[0]:,}\")"
      ],
      "id": "67f4add7",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "### Question 1: Pass Rate on 1st/2nd Down with 10+ Yards to Go\n",
        "\n",
        "This answers which teams passed most often on 1st or 2nd down when they needed at least 10 yards."
      ],
      "id": "a763e89b"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "early_down_long = pbp_scrimmage[\n",
        "    (pbp_scrimmage[\"down\"].isin([1, 2])) &\n",
        "    (pbp_scrimmage[\"ydstogo\"] >= 10)\n",
        "].copy()\n",
        "\n",
        "q1_results = early_down_long.groupby(\"posteam\").agg(\n",
        "    early_down_long_plays=(\"play_id\", \"count\"),\n",
        "    pass_plays=(\"pass\", \"sum\"),\n",
        "    rush_plays=(\"rush\", \"sum\")\n",
        ").reset_index()\n",
        "\n",
        "q1_results[\"early_down_pass_rate_pct\"] = (\n",
        "    q1_results[\"pass_plays\"] / q1_results[\"early_down_long_plays\"] * 100\n",
        ").round(2)\n",
        "\n",
        "q1_results = q1_results.sort_values(\"early_down_pass_rate_pct\", ascending=False)\n",
        "q1_results[\"early_down_pass_rate_rank\"] = range(1, len(q1_results) + 1)\n",
        "\n",
        "q1_results.head(10)"
      ],
      "id": "83898e1a",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "### Question 2: Fourth Down Attempts and Success Rate\n",
        "\n",
        "This answers which teams went for it most often on 4th down and how often they converted."
      ],
      "id": "3bbcf0a6"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "fourth_down_attempts = pbp_scrimmage[\n",
        "    (pbp_scrimmage[\"down\"] == 4) &\n",
        "    (pbp_scrimmage[\"play_type\"].isin([\"pass\", \"run\"]))\n",
        "].copy()\n",
        "\n",
        "q2_results = fourth_down_attempts.groupby(\"posteam\").agg(\n",
        "    fourth_down_attempts=(\"play_id\", \"count\"),\n",
        "    fourth_down_conversions=(\"fourth_down_converted\", \"sum\"),\n",
        "    fourth_down_failures=(\"fourth_down_failed\", \"sum\")\n",
        ").reset_index()\n",
        "\n",
        "q2_results[\"fourth_down_success_rate_pct\"] = (\n",
        "    q2_results[\"fourth_down_conversions\"] / q2_results[\"fourth_down_attempts\"] * 100\n",
        ").round(2)\n",
        "\n",
        "q2_results = q2_results.sort_values(\"fourth_down_attempts\", ascending=False)\n",
        "q2_results[\"fourth_down_attempt_rank\"] = range(1, len(q2_results) + 1)\n",
        "\n",
        "q2_results.head(10)"
      ],
      "id": "09a66bda",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "### Question 3: Average Plays Per Scoring Drive\n",
        "\n",
        "This answers which teams scored in the fewest plays on average."
      ],
      "id": "d077ccac"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "scoring_drive_plays = pbp_scrimmage[pbp_scrimmage[\"drive_ended_with_score\"] == 1].copy()\n",
        "\n",
        "unique_scoring_drives = scoring_drive_plays.groupby(\n",
        "    [\"game_id\", \"posteam\", \"drive\"]\n",
        ").agg(\n",
        "    plays_in_scoring_drive=(\"drive_play_count\", \"max\")\n",
        ").reset_index()\n",
        "\n",
        "q3_results = unique_scoring_drives.groupby(\"posteam\").agg(\n",
        "    total_scoring_drives=(\"drive\", \"count\"),\n",
        "    avg_plays_per_scoring_drive=(\"plays_in_scoring_drive\", \"mean\")\n",
        ").reset_index()\n",
        "\n",
        "q3_results[\"avg_plays_per_scoring_drive\"] = q3_results[\"avg_plays_per_scoring_drive\"].round(2)\n",
        "\n",
        "q3_results = q3_results.sort_values(\"avg_plays_per_scoring_drive\")\n",
        "q3_results[\"scoring_drive_efficiency_rank\"] = range(1, len(q3_results) + 1)\n",
        "\n",
        "q3_results.head(10)"
      ],
      "id": "9189bbaa",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "### Question 4: Red Zone Touchdown Rate\n",
        "\n",
        "This answers which teams scored touchdowns most often on plays inside the opponent's 20-yard line."
      ],
      "id": "c7743628"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "red_zone_plays = pbp_scrimmage[pbp_scrimmage[\"in_red_zone\"] == 1].copy()\n",
        "\n",
        "q4_results = red_zone_plays.groupby(\"posteam\").agg(\n",
        "    red_zone_plays=(\"play_id\", \"count\"),\n",
        "    red_zone_touchdowns=(\"touchdown\", \"sum\")\n",
        ").reset_index()\n",
        "\n",
        "q4_results[\"red_zone_td_rate_pct\"] = (\n",
        "    q4_results[\"red_zone_touchdowns\"] / q4_results[\"red_zone_plays\"] * 100\n",
        ").round(2)\n",
        "\n",
        "q4_results = q4_results.sort_values(\"red_zone_td_rate_pct\", ascending=False)\n",
        "q4_results[\"red_zone_td_rank\"] = range(1, len(q4_results) + 1)\n",
        "\n",
        "q4_results.head(10)"
      ],
      "id": "be7ce92c",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "### Combine Results into Final Dataset\n",
        "\n",
        "Now we merge the four result tables into one final dataset, so each team has all of its metrics in the same row."
      ],
      "id": "4c6578df"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "final_dataset = q1_results[\n",
        "    [\"posteam\", \"early_down_long_plays\", \"early_down_pass_rate_pct\", \"early_down_pass_rate_rank\"]\n",
        "].copy()\n",
        "\n",
        "final_dataset = final_dataset.merge(\n",
        "    q2_results[[\"posteam\", \"fourth_down_attempts\", \"fourth_down_success_rate_pct\", \"fourth_down_attempt_rank\"]],\n",
        "    on=\"posteam\",\n",
        "    how=\"outer\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "final_dataset = final_dataset.merge(\n",
        "    q3_results[[\"posteam\", \"total_scoring_drives\", \"avg_plays_per_scoring_drive\", \"scoring_drive_efficiency_rank\"]],\n",
        "    on=\"posteam\",\n",
        "    how=\"outer\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "final_dataset = final_dataset.merge(\n",
        "    q4_results[[\"posteam\", \"red_zone_plays\", \"red_zone_td_rate_pct\", \"red_zone_td_rank\"]],\n",
        "    on=\"posteam\",\n",
        "    how=\"outer\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "final_dataset = final_dataset.fillna(0)\n",
        "final_dataset = final_dataset.sort_values(\"posteam\").reset_index(drop=True)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"Final dataset shape:\", final_dataset.shape)\n",
        "final_dataset.head()"
      ],
      "id": "5490561d",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
